      "side": 1,
      "message": "The code was written in 2018:\n\nhttps://crsrc.org/c/base/no_destructor.h;l\u003d1?q\u003dnodestructor\u0026ss\u003dchromium",
      "revId": "ba4934f5d7167ba95939573c20be12105a6d98fa",
