    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "343b3d54_f4d338f0",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 0,
      "author": {
        "id": 5210
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-08-07T14:24:43Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "But, this is not the exact same file it has been changed, and needs a new copyright. It is a new work derived from previous work.",
      "revId": "ba4934f5d7167ba95939573c20be12105a6d98fa",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "475bb019_630fe502",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 0,
      "author": {
        "id": 11059
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-08-07T14:25:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "OK. (Is there a resource to look at to figure out the rules here?)",
      "parentUuid": "343b3d54_f4d338f0",
      "revId": "ba4934f5d7167ba95939573c20be12105a6d98fa",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "5cdd3be1_fd75cb1b",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 0,
      "author": {
        "id": 5631
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-08-07T14:27:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes: https://g3doc.corp.google.com/company/teams/opensource/copyright.md?cl\u003dhead#the-year\n\nInterestingly, those suggest (if anything) extending the range of years as files are edited. I think our usual policy fits with what\u0027s described, though - when a \"new\" file is created (and isn\u0027t a pure copy/move), start with the current year. After that, don\u0027t update it.",
      "parentUuid": "343b3d54_f4d338f0",
      "revId": "ba4934f5d7167ba95939573c20be12105a6d98fa",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "ec038941_807c549d",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 0,
      "author": {
        "id": 5631
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-08-07T14:28:45Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Public link, for posterity: https://opensource.google/documentation/reference/copyright",
      "parentUuid": "5cdd3be1_fd75cb1b",
      "revId": "ba4934f5d7167ba95939573c20be12105a6d98fa",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "f48322ed_4dd5d8d6",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 0,
      "author": {
        "id": 11059
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-08-07T14:30:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I remember reading somewhere that pushing the copyright year forward is actually working against your best interest; e.g., say you discover a competitor is copying your work. You\u0027d rather have an earlier date on your copyright line, not a later one. But that\u0027s anecdotal. The policy link is good.\n\nDo you think this should say `2018-2023`?",
      "parentUuid": "5cdd3be1_fd75cb1b",
      "revId": "ba4934f5d7167ba95939573c20be12105a6d98fa",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "57638ecb_612d73e7",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 0,
      "author": {
        "id": 5631
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-08-07T14:33:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027ve never seen us use the range-of-years pattern elsewhere, so I don\u0027t think I\u0027d start now.",
      "parentUuid": "f48322ed_4dd5d8d6",
      "revId": "ba4934f5d7167ba95939573c20be12105a6d98fa",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "b8e36336_eca7905f",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 0,
      "author": {
        "id": 11059
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-08-07T14:33:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Actually, I think the policy doc indicates that we should not increment the date here.\n\n\u003e NOTE: When a file is re-published with modifications, the copyright notice for that file can (though does not need to be) updated to include the range of years of publication of different versions of that file.",
      "parentUuid": "f48322ed_4dd5d8d6",
      "revId": "ba4934f5d7167ba95939573c20be12105a6d98fa",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "6e50292d_43c4cc60",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 0,
      "author": {
        "id": 5210
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-08-07T14:34:28Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think postdating a copyright is correct here. You want an older copyright to give you an earlier claim.",
      "parentUuid": "f48322ed_4dd5d8d6",
      "revId": "ba4934f5d7167ba95939573c20be12105a6d98fa",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
