      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e I don\u0027t think postdating a copyright is correct here. You want an older copyright to give you an earlier claim.\n\n+1, that\u0027s what I\u0027m saying as well",
      "parentUuid": "6e50292d_43c4cc60",
